WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.962
Creativity is fancy problem solving.

00:00:03.012 --> 00:00:06.075
Start with the brief, then the expected response.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:10.522
Dig for the real problem underneath, and only then build the solution.

00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:13.553
Extra's brief: sell more gum.

00:00:13.603 --> 00:00:15.251
The expected response?

00:00:15.301 --> 00:00:16.983
A bigger ad.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.148
But the real problem?

00:00:19.198 --> 00:00:22.909
At the checkout, everyone's on their phone and never notices the gum.

00:00:22.959 --> 00:00:26.570
So the Bad Breath Index put gum into the checkout itself.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:31.785
Use it like this: brief the problem, not what you want to say.
